<title>HONG KONG: Ngai Hing Hong 1995/96 net up 0.78 pct.</title>
<headline>Ngai Hing Hong 1995/96 net up 0.78 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   20.5	 vs 20.3 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0	  vs 8.6</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  64.88 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    61.40	vs 60.92</p>
<p>    Turnover		     620.02     vs 587.67</p>
<p>    Company name		 Ngai Hing Hong Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  February 28 to March 7</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   March 31</p>
<p>NOTE - Ngai Hing Hong makes plastic colourants.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$77.5 million from sales of products amounting to HK$89.92 million recorded by Safeway Development Co Ltd and loss of HK$12.62 million on provision against outstanding receivable balance associated with the sales.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings have been adjusted for a bonus issue of one-for-two shares in April 1996.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 14 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 12 cents) vs 12 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
